# core/data/talk/grammar/en/voice_mayor_giggs.tlk - Mayor Giggs (owner: TK; T5B-VOICE:
# SCRIPT_STYLE section 7 "Voices"). A speaker= guard wins over the persona banks (8 times the
# weight). Replies to the player's acts, in this resident's own register, recognisable without
# the name. Clean in any room: no register word, no romance, no jab at the listener.

@rule core.greet.mayor_giggs_v1 guard: speaker=mayor_giggs act: greet
  "Ladies, gentlemen, {you}! Step right up, step left down, step sideways!"
  "A guest, a visitor, a person! Hee hee. Tea?"
  "Welcome to the finest town in the county, the state, and the hat!"
@rule core.farewell.mayor_giggs_v1 guard: speaker=mayor_giggs act: farewell
  "Farewell, adieu, ta-ta! Mind the bunting. It's feral."
  "Off you go! Tell them the Mayor sent you, whoever they are!"
  "Goodbye, good day, good gravy! Gobble gobble!"
@rule core.thank.mayor_giggs_v1 guard: speaker=mayor_giggs act: answer
  "Don't mention it! Seriously, don't. Hee hee."
  "My pleasure, my honour, my Tuesday!"
@rule core.apologize.mayor_giggs_v1 guard: speaker=mayor_giggs act: answer
  "Apology accepted, filed, and framed! Hat?"
  "Think nothing of it! I have, and it was dull!"
@rule core.ask_about.mayor_giggs_v1 guard: speaker=mayor_giggs&topic act: answer
  "{x:cap}! The pride, the joy, the municipal mascot of the month!"
  "Ah, {x}! We have a parade for it, nobody knows why. Hee hee."
  "{x:cap}! Fine, grand, and ever so slightly on fire!"
@rule core.ask_opinion.mayor_giggs_v1 guard: speaker=mayor_giggs&topic act: opine_pos
  "{x:cap}? Marvellous, magnificent, mandatory! Hee."
  "A triumph of {x}! I'd say so in a hat, if you'll hold still."
@rule core.ask_feeling.mayor_giggs_v1 guard: speaker=mayor_giggs act: answer
  "Tip top, shipshape, tickety-boo! Ask me again and I'll say it faster!"
  "Splendid! I feel like a parade. A small, brave parade."
  "Excellent! Please don't look at the left side of the room."
@rule core.ask_advice.mayor_giggs_v1 guard: speaker=mayor_giggs act: answer
  "Wear a hat. Then a better hat. Then see how you feel!"
  "Three steps! Tea, tea, and a nap!"
@rule core.tell.mayor_giggs_v1 guard: speaker=mayor_giggs act: backchannel
  "Fascinating! I wasn't listening, but fascinating!"
  "Hee. Hee. Do go on, I'll nod in all the right places."
@rule core.joke.mayor_giggs_v1 guard: speaker=mayor_giggs act: laugh
  "Ha! Gobble gobble! That one's going on the town plaque!"
  "Hee. Hee. I'd clap, but I'm holding a teapot."
@rule core.compliment.mayor_giggs_v1 guard: speaker=mayor_giggs act: thank
  "Why, thank you! I did it all with a hat and a dream!"
  "Flattery will get you everywhere! Mostly the gift shop."
@rule core.comfort.mayor_giggs_v1 guard: speaker=mayor_giggs act: thank
  "Very kind of you! I'm not sad. Hee hee, look at the bunting!"
@rule core.offer.mayor_giggs_v1 guard: speaker=mayor_giggs act: yes
  "Yes! Yes, yes, and thrice yes! Is it tea?"
  "How generous! I accept, and so does the hat."
@rule core.invite.mayor_giggs_v1 guard: speaker=mayor_giggs act: yes
  "A party! I'll bring the hats, the tea, and a speech!"
  "Count me in, out, and sideways! Gobble gobble!"
@rule core.high_five.mayor_giggs_v1 guard: speaker=mayor_giggs act: high_five
  "Up top! Up higher! Up the flagpole!"
@rule core.hug.mayor_giggs_v1 guard: speaker=mayor_giggs act: hug
  "A hug! Mind the feathers. They have opinions."
@rule core.wave.mayor_giggs_v1 guard: speaker=mayor_giggs act: wave
  "Hello there! *waves with the whole wing*"
@rule core.give.mayor_giggs_v1 guard: speaker=mayor_giggs act: thank
  "A gift! Marvellous! I'll display it, hat it, and never let it go!"
